 point 2.**\nHistorical and cultural missteps, like the Sikh/Muslim mix-up in *Bend It Like Beckham*, demonstrate the need for careful vetting in arts and heritage reporting.\n\n---\n**P.P.S.** *Note: All paraphrased content adheres strictly to the original *Guardian* corrections, prioritizing factual alignment over stylistic embellishment.*", "logprobs": [{"token": "**", "logprob": -0.36049768328666687}, {"token": "Section", "logprob": -0.005402607377618551}, {"token": " ", "logprob": -7.70062324590981e-05}, {"token": "1", "logprob": -0.00017212340026162565}, {"token": "**\n", "logprob": -0.20202267169952393}, {"token": "A", "logprob": -1.5157840251922607}, {"token": " recent", "logprob": -0.3046281039714813}, {"token": " *", "logprob": -1.0648577213287354}, {"token": "Guard", "logprob": -0.0025248811580240726}, {"token": "ian", "logprob": -0.00011038171214750037}, {"token": "*", "logprob": -9.97731985989958e-05}, {"token": " article", "logprob": -0.3613567054271698}, {"token": " about", "logprob": -1.9269533157348633}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.6193983554840088}, {"token": " new", "logprob": -0.16751208901405334}, {"token": " UK", "logprob": -3.6763510704040527}, {"token": " law", "logprob": -0.02443390153348446}, {"token": " aimed", "logprob": -1.8922606706619263}, {"token": " at", "logprob": -0.00029869386344216764}, {"token": " tack", "logprob": -1.6163867712020874}, {"token": "ling", "logprob": -0.00014256415306590497}, {"token": " pet", "logprob": -0.17066046595573425}, {"token": " theft", "logprob": -0.03888304904103279}, {"token": " clarified", "logprob": -1.1398420333862305}, {"token": " that", "logprob": -0.21737955510616302}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.42444366216659546}, {"token": " legislation", "logprob": -0.3052080273628235}, {"token": " actually", "logprob": -1.9232110977172852}, {"token": " applies", "logprob": -0.4196573495864868}, {"token": " solely", "logprob": -2.4466490745544434}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -0.025818686932325363}, {"